o(9,3,'explanation','The prompt states that all ten backends are healthy.')
u(9,['workedExample'],'Under the stated one-connection-per-instance setup, four TCP connections landed on four backends. All streams on each connection follow its assigned backend. A gRPC channel is not inherently limited to one connection. Per-call load balancing can use an HTTP/2-aware proxy or a configured client-side policy across backend connections; each already-running stream still stays with its chosen backend.')
